  "details": "I think you would make more money if you added an 18+ addon like chillout VR did, so people don't have to worry about having their NSFW avatars deleted/banned, and people that don't have the addon cant see the 18+ of the avatars at all, but that's just me I hope this gets read and possibly implemented into the game, btw the addon should be a one-time purchase because if you have it monthly or yearly, it will get you more money sure, but it will also be useless at the same time because the second it expires and a player goes into a public world, people that don't have the 18+ addon can see the avatar and then get it banned ( the price could be around $10 for the one time payment)",
